WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:02.630
Let's see...

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:07.910
"...I have spent whole days before this inkstone, with nothing better to do,

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:12.270
jotting down at random whatever nonsensical..."

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.530
<i>The student council president is so amazing!</i>

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.070
Okay, that'll do.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.640
Well then, who can interpret what he just read? {Removed 'we have to.' I'd like to change 'shall' to 'will' or 'can,' but I suspect she's speaking too formally for that both now and later. Oh, and added in the 'properly' to reflect the sense of that first guy utterly failing.}

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.330
Tsubomi!

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.420
Erika, you try interpreting it.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.050
What?! Me?!

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.300
Let's see...

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.920
Ms. Tsurusaki!

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.680
Erika was only trying to get me to pay attention!

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.900
I'll interpret it! I mean, please let me interpret it!

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.730
Well, if you say so, Tsubomi. I guess that's fine.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.020
Sorry about that, Erika.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:01:00.710
"With nothing to really do, I sit at my desk and think to myself

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:05.670
of all those pointless and silly things, and incoherently write them.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.210
It feels so very strange, as though something has exhausted me."

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:11.500
Very well interpreted.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:17.390
<i>Essays in Idleness</i> is something my grandma used to read to me when I was in primary school, so...

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:19.010
I see.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:22.040
Well then, who shall we have go next...

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.220
I think...

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:24.280
Erika.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.980
Whaaaaat?!

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:27.000
{OP}

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:30.190
HeartCatch

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:31.650
Precure!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.200
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.200
Now, all together

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:40.710
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:43.670
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:51.290
Within each of our chests,

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:53.960
they begin to sprout

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.590
The seeds of the heart

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:56.880
are growing

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:59.510
bit by bit

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:00.180
Red,

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:00.800
white

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.090
and yellow

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.890
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.310
all varied colors

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:07.770
that they

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.940
shine so brightly!

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:15.280
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.780
with such care

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.490
will never wither

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:24.080
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.960
Now, all together

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.410
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.080
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.960
They're always right by our sides

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:37.800
So together

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.680
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.640
bloom even more!

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.140
HeartCatch

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.640
Precure!

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:56.310
You made interpreting that look so easy, and without doing any studying either!

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:59.360
And you're great at science too! You're really amazing, Tsubomi!

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.950
Really, it's all thanks to my grandma.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:06.090
Oh, that's right. She runs the 
botanical gardens, doesn't she?

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:06.950
Yeah.

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:11.960
More importantly, Tsubomi... why were you spacing out earlier?

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:13.480
Huh?

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.750
W-Well, that was because...

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:22.700
It's the student council president!

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:24.180
Shoot! {Changed 'god' to 'shoot.' STOP MAKING MY ADORABLE LITTLE GIRLS SAY UNPLEASANT THINGS.}

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:28.680
It seems you know why I'm here, Kurumi.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.750
Uh, yes! About the club roster, right?

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.940
The submission deadline has already passed, you realize.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:37.650
If you don't hand it in by the end of the day, I'll 
have no choice but to disband the Fashion Club.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.110
No way!

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:42.110
That's how it is. If you'll excuse me, then.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.240
He's so manly!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.500
<i>Wh-What am I gonna do?!</i>

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.710
<i>I only need to find three more members...</i>

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.900
Toshiko, Naomi, Rumiko!

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:01.050
Please join the Fashion Club!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.630
I'm begging you!

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:05.610
It's not that simple, ya know...

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:09.080
I do have an interest in style,
 but not enough to join a club...

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.480
We can do something about that!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:11.760
Oh, I know!

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:15.810
How about a 20% discount at our shop?

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.610
Give us a little more!

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:25.130
Well, in that case... {Added comma.}

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.870
I'll throw in our special Fairy Drop-Style Notebook!

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.610
Whoa!

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:31.750
We're in!

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:34.880
Thank goodness...

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.340
Welcome to the group!

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.880
My Beloved Student Council Prez<i>!</i>

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.880
My Beloved Student Council Prez<i>!</i>

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.050
S{*\fax-0.044}t{*\fax-0.038}u{*\fax-0.031}d{*\fax-0.025}e{*\fax-0.019}n{*\fax-0.012}t C{*\fax-0.008}o{*\fax-0.015}u{*\fax-0.023}n{*\fax-0.031}c{*\fax-0.038}i{*\fax-0.046}l {*\fax-0.062}O{*\fax-0.069}f{*\fax-0.077}f{*\fax-0.085}i{*\fax-0.092}ce

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:50.750
Kurumi and Hanasaki from the Fashion Club coming in!

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:58.060
Um... is the president here?

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.530
Myoudouin just went home, I'm afraid.

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:05.200
We've brought the roster for the Fashion Club, you see, and...

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.530
We've already decided to disband the Fashion Club, I'm afraid.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.100
No way!

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:13.540
We've had so many class duties to take care of that we ran late, that's all!

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:17.690
Myoudouin is not the type of person to overturn an already-made decision.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:21.950
The president had been holding out for you, even though the deadline had passed.

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:25.550
Even today, the president waited for you as long as possible before leaving...

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.220
Erika... what do we do?!

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:34.730
We have no choice but to head to the president's home and engage in face-to-face negotiations!

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:43.900
Itsuki is currently engaging in martial arts training with our fellow pupils, I'm afraid.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.870
We'll wait as long as we have to!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:50.010
There's something we need to 
discuss, and it has to be today!

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.280
Very well, then.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:59.900
Once his training has finished, I shall call Itsuki for you.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:01.090
Thank you very much.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.460
This is annoying... I really suck at sitting on my legs like this.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:15.040
Wow! He's so cool!

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.970
He's just too cool...

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.800
Oy.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:19.780
Hrm?

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.060
What's the matter?

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:24.980
You'll regret falling for the student council president, you know? {Added 'student.'}

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.120
Huh?

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:29.880
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:33.190
Oh, I'm sorry...

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:38.010
Let me warn you: The student council president is... {Added 'student.' Also, he's gay, isn't he?}

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.830
Us gossiping will distract him from his practice, you know.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:51.790
Could this rush in my heart be...

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:53.760
my first love?!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.010
I'm telling you...

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.980
I can't stop this, even if I wanted to!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:00.440
My love only grows stronger!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.100
...I'm not taking the blame for this.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.120
That shall suffice.

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.190
You have some visitors.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:21.270
He's coming closer. What do I do?!

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:22.500
Kurumi?

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.630
You have some business with me?

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.100
Oh, right!

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.680
My legs fell asleep...

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:32.160
Erika, are you all right?!

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:33.980
Y-Yeah...

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:36.100
Um... President! {Added 'student.'}

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.270
Let's talk about this outside, all right?

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:45.790
Please don't disband the Fashion Club! {Added 'student.' Why did you stop putting it in there, anyways?}

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:48.730
As you can see, we've completed our roster!

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:52.150
However, the board of directors has already approved the list of clubs.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:55.200
But you told us we had to get it to you by the end of the day!

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:58.270
We just got delayed by our duties, that's all!

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:04.290
Tsubomi, what are you doing?

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.920
You need to ask as well!

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:10.510
We're begging you! Please don't disband the Fashion Club!

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:17.350
I suppose I did have to leave early, what with today being a training day at our dojo... {Got rid of the 'And' at the start - it just doesn't flow well unless from another statement of his.}

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:19.840
Very well then.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:24.480
I'll talk with the board of directors again and make sure the Fashion Club is allowed to continue. {Added 'board of.' Abbreviating terms are okay, but they really take on different enough meanings that it's worth keeping the full term.}

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.270
Thank you so much!

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.530
We did it!

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.650
Thank goodness!

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:33.000
M'lady...

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:33.960
I brought you some tea.

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:34.860
Oh, thank you.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:36.900
Would you two like some?

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:38.530
Oh, yes please!

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:40.200
M'...

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.830
M'lady?!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.920
The president's a girl. {OH SURE NOW THEY GIVE HER EYELASHES.}

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.130
Everyone at school knows that.

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:52.090
I tried to tell you, but you didn't listen.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:55.650
You only just transferred here, didn't you, Hanasaki?

00:08:55.650 --> 00:09:01.060
Due to the situation here, I may adopt a male appearance, but I am indeed a girl.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.360
I see...

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:06.520
I seeeeeee!

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:11.480
That's why I said you were better off leaving well enough alone. {'Well away' is a British thing, I think. Changed it to 'well enough alone,' a more common phrase.}

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:15.310
I can't believe the student council president was a girl...

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:21.740
My first love lies broken after only three minutes!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:26.480
I guess all I can say is...

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.710
It's great that we can keep the Fashion Club going!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:32.880
That's it?! You're my friend! You're supposed to cheer me up! {'Meant' -> 'supposed.'}

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:36.520
Well, you know... First loves are meant to be bittersweet!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:42.530
I... don't think I'll ever recover from this!

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:46.800
Stop here, please.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.530
I heard some friends of yours came by. {'Round' -> 'by.' Gotta keep the British man down.}

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.710
Yeah.

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:59.320
You mean Kurumi's club?

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:05.280
It's quite unusual for you to have female
 friends come by, so it kinda surprised me.

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:07.790
They aren't... really friends.

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:13.710
I'd like it if you could get along
 better with other girls, you know. {'on' -> 'along.'}

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.210
Brother... {Fuck this family, girls look like boys and boys look like girls.}

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:21.430
Because my body is so weak, it's left the entire burden of the Myoudouin name on your shoulders, but—

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:30.070
S-Sorry...

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:36.380
Brother...

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:41.820
I said... No, I swore I'd look after you until the very end.

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:46.290
I'm fine living the way I do. {Changed 'alright' to 'all right.'}

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.780
So please, don't worry yourself over it.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:55.420
Just don't overdo it. {'Alright' -> 'All right.'}

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.200
You wish to go and defeat the Precure?

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:22.980
Last time, I merely made introductions.

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:25.620
I assure you that this time, I shall defeat them most magnificently.

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:27.520
Very well.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:28.470
Then I beg your leave.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.170
What?! She's taking the day off from school?!

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:37.170
She has a fever from the shock of finding out the student council president was a girl...

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.880
I guess it's understandable.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:42.380
When I was a first year, the exact same thing happened to me.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.840
Tell her to get better soon, anyway!

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:47.010
You got it!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.200
Myoudouin!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.650
Please accept these tokens of our affection!

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.280
Thank you very much.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.320
Well excuse us then!

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:22.420
A man more beautiful than me exists?

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.090
C'est impardonnable...

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:29.080
Even the peony Flower of his Heart is beautiful...

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:34.990
I thought even his heart would be perfectly beautiful,

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.320
but it seems I can make use of him after all.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:53.330
I-It's so cute!

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.080
Embracing your feminine side?

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:57.880
Wh-Who the hell are you?! {She is actually a girl and thus my law of STOP MAKING MY ADORABLE GIRLS SWEAR applies here. Hell -> heck.}

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.840
A handsome man embracing a doll like that...

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.490
is beautiful indeed!

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:07.750
<i>He cut Bunny's ear!</i>

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:19.610
Flower of the Heart, your moment has come!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.040
It's the student council president! {Added 'student.'}

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:36.000
Let us dye this peony with impeccable darkness!

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:43.300
Desertrian, that's your cue! {The preceding scene was not creepy at all. Nope.}

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:49.970
We can't let it run wild around school!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:03.070
Go, Seed of the Precure!

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:06.320
Precure!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:08.110
Open My Heart!

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:52.370
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:56.930
Cure Marine! {I have really missed the solo transformations. Good to see them back.}

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.650
Staaaaatue!

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:17.810
Nooooooooo!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:23.980
This style of girl's uniform is just so cute!

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.980
I... I...

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.530
I want to wear one too! {The formatting of this looks ass-ugly with the ellipses being well underneath the level of the text. How has this never been an issue before?}

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.190
Huh?

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:31.110
Do you know what you're saying?

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.120
But I'm...

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.350
a girl!

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.500
Whaaaaaaaaaaaaaat?!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.790
S-Somebody help me!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.160
Stop that at once!

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:46.290
Statue!

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.900
Hurry and run!

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:51.320
R-Right!

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:52.680
Thank you so much!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.160
So you show yourself at last.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.810
Desertrian, defeat the Precure!

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:04.040
She's so cuuuuute!

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:07.010
You fool! {'bloody IDIOT' sounds too British. Changed it to 'foolish FOOL,' let's see if it flies.}

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:09.490
This really isn't the damn time for that!

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:11.570
Hurry up and defeat the Precure!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:15.830
Staaaaaaaatuuuueee!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.270
Ms. Tsurusaki!

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:25.830
<i>At this rate, everyone'll get turned to stone...</i>

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.300
The student council president?!

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:32.000
You must hurry to Cure Marine's aid!

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:32.880
Right!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.590
President!

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.510
I'll purify you and return you back to normal!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.790
Marine Dive!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:07.920
She's strong...

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.990
Très bien!

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:14.680
Even if you are a girl, you certainly live up to your tomboy image.

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.550
Wh-What's with that look?!

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.890
I am a Commander of the Desert Apostles, I'll have you know!

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.350
What's wrong with me liking dolls, huh?!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:31.940
Just because I have to become an amazing martial artist like my brother, I'm not allowed to like cute things?! {Man, that R just murders the shit out of the comma.}

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:38.350
I just want to do things a normal girl would do! I 
want to be stylish, to play the piano, and do ballet! {Added the second comma.}

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:42.560
I really love cute things!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:50.950
So those are your true feelings... {Removed 'council.}

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:59.450
They forced those feelings you kept locked in your heart to the surface, and turned you into a Desertrian... {NO SHIT IT IS EPISODE 7 YOU SHOULD KNOW HOW THIS WORKS BY NOW.}

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:02.970
I've had it up to here with this!

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:05.640
Marine! Let's hurry and purify her!

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:07.730
Yeah!

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:19.240
